使用，不可发布或进入生产运行。\\\",\\\"slot_id\\\":\\\"publication_scope_authorization\\\",\\\"synthetic_test_only\\\":true}],\\\"claim_boundary\\\":\\\"不能确认改善由稳定衬或张力中的哪一个单独造成，也不能把样布结果直接外推到整件衬衫或其他图案密度。\\\",\\\"facts\\\":[{\\\"authorization_ids\\\":[\\\"G3-CP06-011-AUTH-01\\\"],\\\"fact_id\\\":\\\"G3-CP06-011-FACT-01\\\",\\\"fact_value\\\":\\\"现有两块样布只支撑“皱纹在两项同时调整后减少”，不支撑把改善归给稳定衬或张力中某一个的说法。\\\",\\\"fact_value_digest\\\":\\\"de55b76ca2b809cb48f5d36205d12fc7a0147d764985272551fe3a7784f19cec\\\",\\\"slot_id\\\":\\\"claim support state supplied by runtime\\\",\\\"source_ids\\\":[\\\"G3-CP06-011-SRC-01\\\",\\\"G3-CP06-011-SRC-02\\\"],\\\"synthetic_test_only\\\":true},{\\\"authorization_ids\\\":[\\\"G3-CP06-011-AUTH-01\\\"],\\\"fact_id\\\":\\\"G3-CP06-011-FACT-02\\\",\\\"fact_value\\\":\\\"他同时加了一层可撕稳定衬、把上线路张力从4档降到3档，皱纹数量减少、字母边缘仍完整，但两个变量还没分开验证。\\\",\\\"fact_value_digest\\\":\\\"dd1bb4872200b4fd67a52882769395205d6f91791ff863156883df5fb1473044\\\",\\\"slot_id\\\":\\\"event_or_stage_state\\\",\\\"source_ids\\\":[\\\"G3-CP06-011-SRC-01\\\",\\\"G3-CP06-011-SRC-02\\\"],\\\"synthetic_test_only\\\":true},{\\\"authorization_ids\\\":[\\\"G3-CP06-011-AUTH-01\\\"],\\\"fact_id\\\":\\\"G3-CP06-011-FACT-03\\\",\\\"fact_value\\\":\\\"这只针对这块8厘米密针样布，不能直接说明整件衬衫或其他图案密度会怎样。\\\",\\\"fact_value_digest\\\":\\\"41cdea9e4997001d7fed2e368933ef6b1bbbfaed6a2631d5f7ec554295d60209\\\",\\\"slot_id\\\":\\\"judgment_scope\\\",\\\"source_ids\\\":[\\\"G3-CP06-011-SRC-01\\\",\\\"G3-CP06-011-SRC-02\\\"],\\\"synthetic_test_only\\\":true},{\\\"authorization_ids\\\":[\\\"G3-CP06-011-AUTH-01\\\"],\\\"fact_id\\\":\\\"G3-CP06-011-FACT-04\\\",\\\"fact_value\\\":\\\"一块薄棉样布完成8厘米宽密针字母刺绣后，字母外缘出现放射状细皱；操作员对着斜光看这些皱纹，判断和背面支撑或张力有关。\\\",\\\"fact_value_digest\\\":\\\"d37d9cc52561d4657257f9587a4cf16b4711609f07328a50bca7aae8b69ef808\\\",\\\"slot_id\\\":\\\"observable_signal\\\",\\\"source_ids\\\":[\\\"G3-CP06-011-SRC-01\\\",\\\"G3-CP06-011-SRC-02\\\"],\\\"synthetic_test_only\\\":true},{\\\"authorization_ids\\\":[\\\"G3-CP06-011-AUTH-01\\\"],\\\"fact_id\\\":\\\"G3-CP06-011-FACT-05\\\",\\\"fact_value\\\":\\\"他检查发现原样布背面只有水溶薄膜、没有框外预留支撑，据此判断皱纹可能来自支撑不足或张力偏高。\\\",\\\"fact_value_digest\\\":\\\"b17acebdd9c186ae8a46ba832a33a845c8acd3e6c1743a66a883dfb1e7943b05\\\",\\\"slot_id\\\":\\\"professional_basis\\\",\\\"source_ids\\\":[\\\"G3-CP06-011-SRC-01\\\",\\\"G3-CP06-011-SRC-02\\\"],\\\"synthetic_test_only\\\":true},{\\\"authorization_ids\\\":[\\\"G3-CP06-011-AUTH-01\\\"],\\\"fact_id\\\":\\\"G3-CP06-011-FACT-06\\\",\\\"fact_value\\\":\\\"镜头可让斜光扫过皱纹，再拍背面衬料和机器张力旋钮，声音保留绣框卡合与机器节奏。\\\",\\\"fact_value_digest\\\":\\\"9ce7b281562dd51c61ffe005525bbc8d306aad41e3863d2f4ec5be04c33f85ce\\\",\\\"slot_id\\\":\\\"runtime supplies visible details and available view path\\\",\\\"source_ids\\\":[\\\"G3-CP06-011-SRC-01\\\",\\\"G3-CP06-011-SRC-02\\\"],\\\"synthetic_test_only\\\":true},{\\\"authorization_ids\\\":[\\\"G3-CP06-011-AUTH-01\\\"],\\\"fact_id\\\":\\\"G3-CP06-011-FACT-07\\\",\\\"fact_value\\\":\\\"只有两项一起改的结果，除非再做一块仅改稳定衬、不动张力的对照片，否则说不清是哪一个在起作用。\\\",\\\"fact_value_digest\\\":\\\"2da979dce39f9085e1b002bcff0517776970a2a187d177274bb0b2979ad6b763\\\",\\\"slot_id\\\":\\\"unresolved_condition\\\",\\\"source_ids\\\":[\\\"G3-CP06-011-SRC-01\\\",\\\"G3-CP06-011-SRC-02\\\"],\\\"synthetic_test_only\\\":true},{\\\"authorization_ids\\\":[\\\"G3-CP06-011-AUTH-01\\\"],\\\"fact_id\\\":\\\"G3-CP06-011-FACT-08\\\",\\\"fact_value\\\":\\\"斜光扫过皱纹的深浅、背面稳定衬的层次、张力旋钮从4到3的位置，都是能拍到的细节。\\\",\\\"fact_value_digest\\\":\\\"c0e7c8530c80d42f2748165d1980d837ded21de1f894395eeebeaf6e6107cba0\\\",\\\"slot_id\\\":\\\"visible detail supplied by runtime\\\",\\\"source_ids\\\":[\\\"G3-CP06-011-SRC-01\\\",\\\"G3-CP06-011-SRC-02\\\"],\\\"synthetic_test_only\\\":true},{\\\"authorization_ids\\\":[\\\"G3-CP06-011-AUTH-01\\\"],\\\"fact_id\\\":\\\"G3-CP06-011-FACT-09\\\",\\\"fact_value\\\":\\\"画面是绣框上的薄棉样布，正反面、稳定衬和机器上线路张力旋钮同框。\\\",\\\"fact_value_digest\\\":\\\"c58bf7e86e755d2eb6862c8d7b7796c1640988dfbd60bfe5f238a86859c4e46c\\\",\\\"slot_id\\\":\\\"visible_context\\\",\\\"source_ids\\\":[\\\"G3-CP06-011-SRC-01\\\",\\\"G3-CP06-011-SRC-02\\\"],\\\"synthetic_test_only\\\":true},{\\\"authorization_ids\\\":[\\\"G3-CP06-011-AUTH-01\\\"],\\\"fact_id\\\":\\\"G3-CP06-011-FACT-10\\\",\\\"fact_value\\\":\\\"稳定衬和张力两项一块改，改完才见好；单拎一项对照的样片没人摆出来，哪项在使劲缺旁证。这块8厘米样布的结果，搬到整件衬衫或别的图案密度会怎样，没谁替它走一遍。\\\",\\\"fact_value_digest\\\":\\\"9b58a58f02484b06976f57346b27ddddce70251b6bcd6dc1fd1277405ee7de37\\\",\\\"slot_id\\\":\\\"claim_boundary\\\",\\\"source_ids\\\":[\\\"G3-CP06-011-SRC-01\\\",\\\"G3-CP06-011-SRC-02\\\"],\\\"synthetic_test_only\\\":true}],\\\"sources\\\":[{\\\"slot_id\\\":\\\"usable_source_materials\\\",\\\"source_id\\\":\\\"G3-CP06-011-SRC-01\\\",\\\"source_summary\\\":\\\"斜光下两块样布正反面、稳定衬层次和张力旋钮位置的近景显示已发生的变化。\\\",\\\"synthetic_test_only\\\":true},{\\\"slot_id\\\":\\\"product_or_scene_reference\\\",\\\"source_id\\\":\\\"G3-CP06-011-SRC-02\\\",\\\"source_summary\\\":\\\"刺绣试片卡记录图案宽度、针迹密度保持不变、两项同时调整及下一块单变量对照计划。\\\",\\\"synthetic_test_only\\\":true}]},\\\"user_goal\\\":\\\"帮助刺绣制作人员面对边缘起皱时分开验证支撑与张力，而不是一次改多项后误判原因。\\\"}\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"status\":\"completed\"}}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
