GE_DECISION`\\\\n6. `CLOSEOUT_REPORT`\\\\n7. `CLOSEOUT_RECEIPT`\\\\n8. `HANDOFF`\\\\n\\\\n另附：\\\\n\\\\n- `ORIGIN_ANCHOR`\\\\n- `RUN_JOURNAL` 最终头记录\\\\n- 两份独立审核报告\\\\n- Codex 签字回执\\\\n- 测试回执\\\\n- 负向攻击矩阵\\\\n- P2—P7 注册表\\\\n- ready-set 计算结果\\\\n- M2 渲染 Prompt 的摘要或 `READY_TO_START` 工件\\\\n\\\\nmanifest 必须采用有界摘要闭包，不得递归包含自身摘要或后生成的签字。\\\\n\\\\nHANDOFF 必须绑定：\\\\n\\\\n- M1 accepted candidate；\\\\n- 控制面提交；\\\\n- active contract set；\\\\n- 输入和输出摘要；\\\\n- 最后绿色测试；\\\\n- 审核回执；\\\\n- M2 入口合同；\\\\n- M2 Prompt 模板摘要；\\\\n- ready-set 结果。\\\\n\\\\n## 二十四、M1 PASS 合取条件\\\\n\\\\n只有以下全部成立，才可写：\\\\n\\\\n```text\\\\nM1_REVIEW_STATE=ACCEPTED\\\\nM1_RESULT=PASS\\\\nM2_START_ELIGIBLE=true\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n合取条件：\\\\n\\\\n```text\\\\nV2_5_ACTIVE_CONTRACT_FROZEN\\\\nAND WORKTREE_INVENTORY_PRESERVED\\\\nAND D0_TEXT_AND_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW_VALID\\\\nAND UPPER_CONTRACT_AND_AUTHORIZATION_MIGRATION_COMPLETE\\\\nAND ALL_KNOWN_23_SITES_MIGRATED\\\\nAND REPOSITORY_WIDE_RESIDUAL_SCAN_PASS\\\\nAND ACTUAL_STATE_SEPARATED_FROM_EXPECTATION\\\\nAND POSITIVE_FUTURE_STATE_TESTS_PASS\\\\nAND NEGATIVE_ATTACK_TESTS_PASS\\\\nAND Y_STATE_MACHINE_PASS\\\\nAND TYPED_RECEIPT_TESTS_PASS\\\\nAND RUN_JOURNAL_RECOVERY_PASS\\\\nAND PROMPT_REGISTRY_P1_TO_P7_COMPLETE\\\\nAND SESSION_EXTERNAL_LAUNCHER_TESTED\\\\nAND SEALED_CUSTODY_TESTS_PASS\\\\nAND PRODUCT_BOUNDARY_AND_LIFT_SCHEMAS_PASS\\\\nAND QUAL_A_B_ORDER_CONTRACT_PASS\\\\nAND RIGHTS_AND_CUSTOMER_DATA_GOVERNANCE_TEMPLATES_PASS\\\\nAND TWO_INDEPENDENT_REVIEWS_BOUND_TO_SAME_CANDIDATE\\\\nAND CODEX_ACCEPTANCE_RECEIPT_VALID\\\\nAND FULL_TEST_SUITE_GREEN\\\\nAND MANIFESTS_RECOMPUTABLE\\\\nAND ORIGIN_ANCHOR_VERIFIED\\\\nAND M0_REMAINS_HONESTLY_NOT_QUALIFIED\\\\nAND V1_1_REMAINS_HONESTLY_NOT_QUALIFIED\\\\nAND M2_NOT_EXECUTED_IN_M1_SESSION\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n任何一项缺失，不得写 PASS。\\\\n\\\\n## 二十五、停止线\\\\n\\\\n仅以下事项允许停止并上报发起人：\\\\n\\\\n- 真源冲突且需要改变 V1.1、产品语义或冻结裁决；\\\\n- 无法保全用户现有修改；\\\\n- Fable 5 模型身份或会话身份无效；\\\\n- 未声明持久记忆无法隔离；\\\\n- 密封材料、凭据或客户数据泄漏；\\\\n- RUN_JOURNAL 无法恢复或与 Git 无法调和；\\\\n- 无